{"unit_id":"FuzzySoul__dsh-free-vision#card-zh","repo":"FuzzySoul/dsh-free-vision","commit":"9daa0dc4b42920c129bec5988765a585a0523843","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-free-vision 是面向 DSH Web 的视觉插件，让纯文本模型也能分析截图、照片、文档和界面。它在 DSH 注册 image_understand 工具，并可把粘贴图片转换成模型可处理的描述；还提供 show_image，将本地或附件图片以内联卡片显示在对话中。主要能力包括 OCR、通用图片问答、界面与报错分析、一步式图片描述，以及多家视觉模型提供商和 API 地址配置。适合需要让 DSH 看图、读取截图文字或在聊天中展示图片的用户。图片分析需要所选提供商的 API Key；设置保存在本地配置文件中。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:611","dsh/index.js:666","dsh/index.js:750","dsh/index.js:919","client/client.js:378"]}
{"unit_id":"FuzzySoul__dsh-free-vision#card-en","repo":"FuzzySoul/dsh-free-vision","commit":"9daa0dc4b42920c129bec5988765a585a0523843","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-free-vision adds image understanding to DSH Web. image_understand answers image questions and performs OCR; pasted images can become descriptions, while show_image displays images inline. Users can choose a vision provider and endpoint. Image analysis needs a provider API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:611","dsh/index.js:666","dsh/index.js:750","dsh/index.js:919","client/client.js:378"]}
