{"unit_id":"FuzzySoul__dsh-free-vision#feature-1","repo":"FuzzySoul/dsh-free-vision","commit":"9daa0dc4b42920c129bec5988765a585a0523843","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-free-vision 的功能「图片理解」：调用 image_understand 分析图片并返回文字。输入图片路径、URL 或 data URI，以及问题和可选任务类型。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:666","dsh/index.js:671","dsh/index.js:707"]}
{"unit_id":"FuzzySoul__dsh-free-vision#feature-2","repo":"FuzzySoul/dsh-free-vision","commit":"9daa0dc4b42920c129bec5988765a585a0523843","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-free-vision 的功能「粘贴图片理解」：发送的图片块会在分发前转换为缓存的视觉描述，让不支持图片输入的文本模型也能据此回答；描述失败时改用图片引用文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:855","dsh/index.js:904","dsh/index.js:911"]}
{"unit_id":"FuzzySoul__dsh-free-vision#feature-3","repo":"FuzzySoul/dsh-free-vision","commit":"9daa0dc4b42920c129bec5988765a585a0523843","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-free-vision 的功能「对话内展示图片」：模型调用 show_image 并传入本地路径、附件引用或 data URI，可附带说明文字；插件保存附件并在对话工具行渲染图片卡片。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:1455","dsh/index.js:1462","dsh/index.js:1543","client/client.js:425"]}
{"unit_id":"FuzzySoul__dsh-free-vision#feature-4","repo":"FuzzySoul/dsh-free-vision","commit":"9daa0dc4b42920c129bec5988765a585a0523843","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-free-vision 的功能「切换视觉服务」：在设置中选择内置提供商或 custom，并为各提供商指定 API Base URL；插件将配置传给视觉引擎以请求对应服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:218","dsh/index.js:225","dsh/index.js:520"]}
{"unit_id":"FuzzySoul__dsh-free-vision#caveat-1","repo":"FuzzySoul/dsh-free-vision","commit":"9daa0dc4b42920c129bec5988765a585a0523843","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-free-vision 使用前须知：图片分析需要配置当前提供商的 API Key；未配置时仍会注册提示工具，但调用会报错。图片内容会交给所选视觉提供商处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:611","dsh/index.js:738","dsh/index.js:527"]}
